# against a temporary copy of the config in `config/`, which holds only
# `init.lean`: the benchmarks time it (tools/module-bench.sh,
# tools/bundle-bench.sh), and `mise run dmg-check` holds the lakefile it
# generates to `expected-lakefile-bundle`
# (crates/editor-release-std/tests/dmg_mount.rs).

